1
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:30,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Silent Storm]</font>

2
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[I'm leaving.
Don't look for me. Jiang Xiaohong]</font>

3
00:02:29,480 --> 00:02:32,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 2]</font>

4
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:43,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bro, where is this?</font>

5
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:44,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You bumpkin,</font>

6
00:02:44,750 --> 00:02:46,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you don't even know Dongle Manor?</font>

7
00:02:46,470 --> 00:02:47,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's so beautiful here.</font>

8
00:02:48,030 --> 00:02:49,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've never been to a place like this.</font>

9
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:50,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So beautiful.</font>

10
00:02:51,030 --> 00:02:53,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When you meet the boss,
don't go running your mouth.</font>

11
00:03:24,470 --> 00:03:25,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

12
00:03:25,470 --> 00:03:26,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

13
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:30,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm tallying the fake invoices</font>

14
00:03:30,190 --> 00:03:31,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that came from Lin Jianye.</font>

15
00:03:32,910 --> 00:03:34,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm going through
his interrogation transcript,</font>

16
00:03:35,030 --> 00:03:36,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">hoping for a breakthrough.</font>

17
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:39,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm stuck.</font>

18
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:40,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about we swap?</font>

19
00:03:45,310 --> 00:03:46,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.</font>

20
00:03:46,590 --> 00:03:48,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This doesn't break any rules.</font>

21
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:50,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It doesn't?</font>

22
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:51,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course not.</font>

23
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:52,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise they wouldn't have</font>

24
00:03:52,870 --> 00:03:54,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">teamed us up to investigate this case</font>

25
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:55,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and recover together.</font>

26
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:56,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

27
00:03:56,910 --> 00:03:57,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, come on.</font>

28
00:04:01,470 --> 00:04:02,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry, take it.</font>

29
00:04:04,430 --> 00:04:05,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ow, ow, ow.</font>

30
00:04:16,630 --> 00:04:17,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This checks out.</font>

31
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:19,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Jianye confessed</font>

32
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:21,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that he made</font>

33
00:04:21,950 --> 00:04:23,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and sold fake invoices by himself.</font>

34
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:24,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you believe that?</font>

35
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:28,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did the printing factory back him up?</font>

36
00:04:28,270 --> 00:04:29,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They did.</font>

37
00:04:29,510 --> 00:04:31,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A run-down room, one machine.</font>

38
00:04:31,480 --> 00:04:32,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He did it alone.</font>

39
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:33,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Impossible.</font>

40
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:35,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With numbers this big,</font>

41
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:36,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how could one person
and one machine print all that?</font>

42
00:04:39,070 --> 00:04:40,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me ask you something professional.</font>

43
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:42,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do the invoices he printed
look authentic?</font>

44
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:45,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The craftsmanship is decent.</font>

45
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:47,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But if you look closely, you can tell.</font>

46
00:04:47,630 --> 00:04:49,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't get too technical with me.</font>

47
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:50,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How authentic?</font>

48
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:50,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">About 70 percent.</font>

49
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:51,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">70 percent?</font>

50
00:04:52,630 --> 00:04:53,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So that means</font>

51
00:04:54,390 --> 00:04:56,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he's either covering for an accomplice,</font>

52
00:04:56,310 --> 00:04:58,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or he wants to take the fall alone.</font>

53
00:04:58,830 --> 00:05:01,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Lin family made such a big scene</font>

54
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just to buy time.</font>

55
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:04,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They must have
cut a deal with Lin Jianye.</font>

56
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:11,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you smell something burning?</font>

57
00:05:12,870 --> 00:05:14,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is your butt on fire?</font>

58
00:05:16,270 --> 00:05:17,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Smell it.</font>

59
00:05:17,870 --> 00:05:19,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your butt is burning.</font>

60
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Smell it yourself.</font>

61
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:21,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's smoking.</font>

62
00:05:21,630 --> 00:05:23,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nurse, move him somewhere else.</font>

63
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's burnt.</font>

64
00:05:25,390 --> 00:05:25,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Over here.</font>

65
00:05:31,510 --> 00:05:33,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How are you? Are you okay?</font>

66
00:05:34,510 --> 00:05:36,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happened that night?</font>

67
00:05:37,510 --> 00:05:38,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

68
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:41,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think I was hit by a car.</font>

69
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:42,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who hit you?</font>

70
00:05:43,870 --> 00:05:46,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't even see before I was hit.</font>

71
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:48,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You didn't see?</font>

72
00:05:48,830 --> 00:05:49,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You gave us quite the scare.</font>

73
00:05:50,510 --> 00:05:52,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That day we found you lying on the road.</font>

74
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:53,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The moment I saw you, I knew</font>

75
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:54,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'd been hit by a car.</font>

76
00:05:55,190 --> 00:05:56,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go on, thank the boss.</font>

77
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:57,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She insisted on saving you</font>

78
00:05:58,310 --> 00:05:59,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and even found a doctor</font>

79
00:05:59,070 --> 00:06:00,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- to examine you head to toe.
- Enough.</font>

80
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:00,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave us.</font>

81
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:14,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you for saving my life, boss.</font>

82
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:16,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You won't even look at me?</font>

83
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:26,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who is Ahong to you?</font>

84
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:29,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's my wife.</font>

85
00:06:31,310 --> 00:06:33,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you want me to call your wife</font>

86
00:06:33,510 --> 00:06:34,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and have her come get you?</font>

87
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:39,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came to Chunjiang to find her.</font>

88
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:41,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She works at
an electronics factory here.</font>

89
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:44,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I went by several days ago,
and they said she'd quit.</font>

90
00:06:44,950 --> 00:06:46,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I... I still haven't found her.</font>

91
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:48,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She couldn't stand being poor with you,</font>

92
00:06:48,630 --> 00:06:49,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so she ran off to Chunjiang.</font>

93
00:06:51,870 --> 00:06:53,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know how big Chunjiang is?</font>

94
00:06:53,630 --> 00:06:54,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How many electronics factories
there are?</font>

95
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have no money, no connections.</font>

96
00:06:58,160 --> 00:06:59,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Finding someone is nearly impossible.</font>

97
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:01,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if you do find her,</font>

98
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:03,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she might've already had kids
with someone else.</font>

99
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:07,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've worked at a printing factory?</font>

100
00:07:09,510 --> 00:07:11,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back in my hometown, it was a</font>

101
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:12,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">state-run printing factory.</font>

102
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:16,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I made paper with my relatives.</font>

103
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:17,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Later, they introduced me to</font>

104
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:18,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">work at the printing factory.</font>

105
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:20,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That factory went bankrupt.</font>

106
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:38,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me, what kinds of paper are these?</font>

107
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:47,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is cover offset paper.</font>

108
00:07:48,070 --> 00:07:49,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Weighs 60 to 180 grams.</font>

109
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:51,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Inner pages, 50 grams.</font>

110
00:07:51,870 --> 00:07:52,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Multi-color printing.</font>

111
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:58,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This matte coated paper</font>

112
00:07:58,920 --> 00:07:59,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is more expensive.</font>

113
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:01,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Inner pages at 157.</font>

114
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:03,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ranges from 105 to 400 grams.</font>

115
00:08:05,870 --> 00:08:08,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one, this one weighs 300 grams.</font>

116
00:08:09,950 --> 00:08:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one is special.</font>

117
00:08:11,040 --> 00:08:13,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's coated paper
combined with newspaper printing.</font>

118
00:08:13,830 --> 00:08:14,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- That's enough.
- It...</font>

119
00:08:15,070 --> 00:08:15,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come here.</font>

120
00:08:21,310 --> 00:08:23,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want embossed printing on this paper.</font>

121
00:08:23,680 --> 00:08:24,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you do it?</font>

122
00:08:27,830 --> 00:08:29,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The paper is too thin.</font>

123
00:08:29,190 --> 00:08:30,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The ink won't hold.</font>

124
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:31,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you fix it?</font>

125
00:08:51,630 --> 00:08:54,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The cotton-to-fiber ratio is off.</font>

126
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:54,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's very simple.</font>

127
00:08:54,870 --> 00:08:55,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just need to adjust it.</font>

128
00:08:56,270 --> 00:08:57,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But ink isn't my thing...</font>

129
00:08:57,960 --> 00:08:58,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll handle the ink.</font>

130
00:08:59,510 --> 00:09:00,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You help me get the paper done.</font>

131
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:10,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Boss.</font>

132
00:09:10,120 --> 00:09:12,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I might need to go find my wife first.</font>

133
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:13,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once I find her,</font>

134
00:09:13,670 --> 00:09:15,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll come back and help you with it.</font>

135
00:09:15,510 --> 00:09:16,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm called Ahong too.</font>

136
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:19,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on, just call me Ms. Ahong.</font>

137
00:09:22,270 --> 00:09:23,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As for your wife,</font>

138
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:24,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll help you find her.</font>

139
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:27,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, Ms. Ahong.</font>

140
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:28,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

141
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:14,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You stole the electrotype plate?</font>

142
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:18,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's like cutting
the Lin family's legs off.</font>

143
00:10:19,510 --> 00:10:20,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm a member of the Lin family too.</font>

144
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:22,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't it the same if it's with me?</font>

145
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:26,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">An invoice plate isn't
a counterfeit-money plate.</font>

146
00:10:26,600 --> 00:10:28,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it worth snatching like that?</font>

147
00:10:28,670 --> 00:10:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Counterfeit money is too risky now.</font>

148
00:10:31,320 --> 00:10:32,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Invoices are different.</font>

149
00:10:32,630 --> 00:10:34,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Low risk, high profit.</font>

150
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:36,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've always run shady businesses.</font>

151
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:39,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I should learn from you.</font>

152
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:41,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Return the electrotype plate,</font>

153
00:10:41,480 --> 00:10:43,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you can stay
at Dongle Manor in peace</font>

154
00:10:43,630 --> 00:10:44,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to run your money house.</font>

155
00:10:44,910 --> 00:10:46,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Lin family won't let you starve.</font>

156
00:10:47,670 --> 00:10:49,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I built this money house myself.</font>

157
00:10:50,510 --> 00:10:51,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It has nothing to do
with the Lin family.</font>

158
00:10:52,030 --> 00:10:53,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then let members of the Lin family</font>

159
00:10:54,030 --> 00:10:55,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">work with you on it.</font>

160
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:57,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're really impressive.</font>

161
00:10:58,270 --> 00:10:59,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't even discussed
the business yet,</font>

162
00:11:00,030 --> 00:11:01,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you're already trying to swallow it.</font>

163
00:11:02,480 --> 00:11:05,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You said it, we're family.</font>

164
00:11:06,910 --> 00:11:08,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm afraid the Lin family</font>

165
00:11:09,030 --> 00:11:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will kick me out someday.</font>

166
00:11:11,510 --> 00:11:13,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back then, it was you</font>

167
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:14,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who held my hand
and made me sign the clan pact.</font>

168
00:11:15,390 --> 00:11:17,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now that Lin Jianye has been arrested,</font>

169
00:11:17,750 --> 00:11:19,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">give the invoice business to me.</font>

170
00:11:19,670 --> 00:11:21,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll pay you every month,</font>

171
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:23,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">more than Lin Jianye did.</font>

172
00:11:24,790 --> 00:11:25,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I only handle printing.</font>

173
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:27,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know who they sell them to</font>

174
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:29,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or what numbers they write on them.</font>

175
00:11:29,790 --> 00:11:30,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It has nothing to do with me.</font>

176
00:11:30,840 --> 00:11:32,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whether it has anything to do with you,</font>

177
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:33,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is that for you to decide?</font>

178
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:34,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How much do I even make?</font>

179
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:36,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why would it have
anything to do with me?</font>

180
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:38,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Still talking tough.</font>

181
00:11:40,270 --> 00:11:41,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How many people?</font>

182
00:11:41,750 --> 00:11:42,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I printed them alone.</font>

183
00:11:43,030 --> 00:11:44,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I sold them alone too.</font>

184
00:11:44,870 --> 00:11:46,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did it all myself.</font>

185
00:12:02,790 --> 00:12:03,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Han.</font>

186
00:12:04,550 --> 00:12:05,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief Zhang.</font>

187
00:12:05,030 --> 00:12:05,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did it go?</font>

188
00:12:07,240 --> 00:12:08,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The letter of introduction was approved.</font>

189
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:08,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good.</font>

190
00:12:08,670 --> 00:12:10,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your tax department can sit in
on the interrogation.</font>

191
00:12:10,600 --> 00:12:12,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you can only provide materials.</font>

192
00:12:12,510 --> 00:12:13,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't interfere with the interrogation.</font>

193
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:16,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Great. Thank you.</font>

194
00:12:16,510 --> 00:12:17,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're welcome.</font>

195
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:18,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If there's nothing else, I'll take off.</font>

196
00:12:18,630 --> 00:12:19,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Carry on.</font>

197
00:12:19,150 --> 00:12:19,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, okay.</font>

198
00:12:20,870 --> 00:12:21,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

199
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:23,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master.</font>

200
00:12:31,150 --> 00:12:32,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Brat.</font>

201
00:12:32,870 --> 00:12:33,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want to go, right?</font>

202
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:35,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should go.</font>

203
00:12:36,030 --> 00:12:37,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know you.</font>

204
00:12:42,440 --> 00:12:43,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go on.</font>

205
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:46,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

206
00:12:50,630 --> 00:12:51,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come in.</font>

207
00:12:52,390 --> 00:12:53,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hi.</font>

208
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:00,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You caught him,</font>

209
00:13:01,030 --> 00:13:02,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so you handle the interrogation.</font>

210
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:03,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you</font>

211
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:04,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for coming to help.</font>

212
00:13:04,550 --> 00:13:05,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's what we should do.</font>

213
00:13:19,270 --> 00:13:20,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My goodness.</font>

214
00:13:21,120 --> 00:13:23,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's a huge number.</font>

215
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:25,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ones, tens, hundreds,
thousands, ten-thousands,</font>

216
00:13:25,550 --> 00:13:26,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">hundred-thousands, millions,
ten-millions, hundred-millions.</font>

217
00:13:29,720 --> 00:13:30,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well,</font>

218
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:32,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'd better read it.</font>

219
00:13:32,270 --> 00:13:33,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're sensitive to numbers.</font>

220
00:13:33,750 --> 00:13:34,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's a terrifying number.</font>

221
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:36,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen carefully. Listen.</font>

222
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:44,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Jianye, I hate dealing with numbers.</font>

223
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:46,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But because of you,</font>

224
00:13:47,150 --> 00:13:47,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">all our colleagues</font>

225
00:13:47,910 --> 00:13:49,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have been burning
the midnight oil for days,</font>

226
00:13:49,670 --> 00:13:51,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">afraid of making the slightest mistake.</font>

227
00:13:51,440 --> 00:13:52,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As of now,</font>

228
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:54,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the forged invoices we've seized</font>

229
00:13:54,320 --> 00:13:54,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from you</font>

230
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:56,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">total 52,481.</font>

231
00:13:57,240 --> 00:13:58,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They've been distributed nationwide,</font>

232
00:13:58,870 --> 00:13:59,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with a face value</font>

233
00:14:00,150 --> 00:14:02,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of 4,326,840,000</font>

234
00:14:03,030 --> 00:14:04,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">plus 7,321.5.</font>

235
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:06,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The tax revenue lost because of you</font>

236
00:14:07,320 --> 00:14:08,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is nearly 400 million.</font>

237
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:09,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">400 million!</font>

238
00:14:10,720 --> 00:14:12,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are absolutely insane.</font>

239
00:14:14,390 --> 00:14:15,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But don't worry.</font>

240
00:14:16,120 --> 00:14:17,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tax officers nationwide</font>

241
00:14:17,840 --> 00:14:19,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will recover every cent
the country lost,</font>

242
00:14:19,750 --> 00:14:20,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">every last bit of it,</font>

243
00:14:21,720 --> 00:14:22,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and prove worthy</font>

244
00:14:22,870 --> 00:14:24,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of those honest taxpayers.</font>

245
00:14:27,750 --> 00:14:30,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've forged tens
of thousands of invoices,</font>

246
00:14:30,270 --> 00:14:32,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">involving hundred-millions.</font>

247
00:14:32,960 --> 00:14:34,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you catch all that just now?</font>

248
00:14:34,910 --> 00:14:35,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If not,</font>

249
00:14:36,270 --> 00:14:37,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll read it to you again.</font>

250
00:14:38,320 --> 00:14:40,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The evidence is solid.
Still playing tough?</font>

251
00:14:43,240 --> 00:14:45,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jianye was the technical guy.</font>

252
00:14:45,790 --> 00:14:47,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now he's been arrested.</font>

253
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:49,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can only handle street-stall goods.</font>

254
00:14:49,840 --> 00:14:50,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The boss won't accept that,</font>

255
00:14:51,440 --> 00:14:52,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">neither will I.</font>

256
00:14:52,910 --> 00:14:56,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't just snatch an electrotype plate
and take a seat at the table.</font>

257
00:14:56,440 --> 00:14:58,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's also paper and ink.</font>

258
00:15:05,030 --> 00:15:06,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And Lin Jianye isn't the only one</font>

259
00:15:06,870 --> 00:15:07,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with this technique.</font>

260
00:15:10,270 --> 00:15:12,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Check them carefully.
Top-tier counterfeits.</font>

261
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:15,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You and the boss will both be satisfied.</font>

262
00:15:18,870 --> 00:15:20,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since everything is already ready,</font>

263
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:23,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why do you still need to talk to me?</font>

264
00:15:24,720 --> 00:15:25,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The boss says</font>

265
00:15:26,120 --> 00:15:26,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he values old ties.</font>

266
00:15:28,030 --> 00:15:29,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you don't agree,</font>

267
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:30,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he'd rather retire.</font>

268
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:34,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">An old friend who values old ties.</font>

269
00:15:34,910 --> 00:15:35,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Very good.</font>

270
00:15:36,510 --> 00:15:37,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anything else?</font>

271
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:41,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Jianye, your case</font>

272
00:15:41,240 --> 00:15:44,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is already the largest
tax case in the country.</font>

273
00:15:45,150 --> 00:15:47,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't even think about shielding anyone.</font>

274
00:15:47,750 --> 00:15:49,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think carefully about yourself.</font>

275
00:15:58,790 --> 00:16:00,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I only make this little money.</font>

276
00:16:01,670 --> 00:16:02,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why should I take the fall alone?</font>

277
00:16:05,150 --> 00:16:06,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, right.</font>

278
00:16:08,960 --> 00:16:10,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine, I can earn some credit.</font>

279
00:16:11,390 --> 00:16:12,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to earn credit.</font>

280
00:16:14,120 --> 00:16:15,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Jianye will tell sooner or later.</font>

281
00:16:16,120 --> 00:16:18,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you just going to sit by and watch?</font>

282
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:26,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't expect you
to take the electrotype plate.</font>

283
00:16:26,960 --> 00:16:29,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The police didn't find
any evidence against me.</font>

284
00:16:29,510 --> 00:16:32,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By a stroke of luck, it saved everyone.</font>

285
00:16:33,240 --> 00:16:33,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yuxian,</font>

286
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:38,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">hand over the factory's employees
and equipment</font>

287
00:16:39,240 --> 00:16:40,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to Ahong.</font>

288
00:16:41,030 --> 00:16:41,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The sooner the better.</font>

289
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:42,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

290
00:16:44,080 --> 00:16:44,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guangzong.</font>

291
00:16:51,150 --> 00:16:52,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong.</font>

292
00:16:52,910 --> 00:16:54,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're amazing.</font>

293
00:16:55,750 --> 00:16:56,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By the way,</font>

294
00:16:56,750 --> 00:16:59,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the money I put into the money house</font>

295
00:16:59,480 --> 00:17:00,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">counts as an investment.</font>

296
00:17:01,150 --> 00:17:02,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">People's hearts are hard to read.</font>

297
00:17:03,240 --> 00:17:05,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only money is simple.</font>

298
00:17:06,350 --> 00:17:07,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's truly wise.</font>

299
00:17:08,510 --> 00:17:10,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry, your money</font>

300
00:17:11,480 --> 00:17:13,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will be well-managed.</font>

301
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:15,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shouldn't you return
the smuggling business</font>

302
00:17:15,400 --> 00:17:16,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my husband ran before he died to me?</font>

303
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:33,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well, about the invoices,</font>

304
00:17:33,510 --> 00:17:34,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let Li Ahong handle it alone.</font>

305
00:17:35,680 --> 00:17:36,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's cut ties with her completely.</font>

306
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:39,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let her do it.</font>

307
00:17:40,590 --> 00:17:41,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The bigger she makes it, the better.</font>

308
00:17:42,480 --> 00:17:44,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll gobble up her business
when the time comes,</font>

309
00:17:45,240 --> 00:17:46,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just like we did</font>

310
00:17:46,680 --> 00:17:48,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">her husband's back then.</font>

311
00:17:49,440 --> 00:17:50,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our ancestors</font>

312
00:17:51,160 --> 00:17:54,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">made their fortune around Chunjiang.</font>

313
00:17:54,680 --> 00:17:56,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who could out-earn the Lin family?</font>

314
00:17:56,960 --> 00:17:59,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could the Lin family
fear some unrelated woman?</font>

315
00:18:15,720 --> 00:18:16,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, Guangzong.</font>

316
00:18:19,720 --> 00:18:20,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bring it up.</font>

317
00:18:20,750 --> 00:18:21,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

318
00:18:30,590 --> 00:18:32,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guangzong, times are tough.</font>

319
00:18:32,680 --> 00:18:34,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you don't pay up,
I'll have to get rough.</font>

320
00:18:36,480 --> 00:18:37,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right on time.</font>

321
00:18:38,070 --> 00:18:38,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up.</font>

322
00:18:48,510 --> 00:18:49,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up.</font>

323
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:51,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guangzong.</font>

324
00:18:51,270 --> 00:18:52,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who told you to take off the blindfold?</font>

325
00:18:52,510 --> 00:18:53,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who told you to take it off?</font>

326
00:18:53,750 --> 00:18:54,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guangzong.</font>

327
00:18:54,720 --> 00:18:56,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Has the Lin family been too good</font>

328
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:56,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to you northerners?</font>

329
00:18:57,200 --> 00:18:58,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Causing trouble every day.</font>

330
00:18:58,790 --> 00:18:59,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anyone who causes trouble again</font>

331
00:19:00,070 --> 00:19:01,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">gets thrown into the sea.</font>

332
00:19:02,310 --> 00:19:02,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guangzong.</font>

333
00:19:03,880 --> 00:19:05,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's Hu Qianguang again.</font>

334
00:19:05,750 --> 00:19:07,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He was always causing trouble
back in Dahang.</font>

335
00:19:07,550 --> 00:19:08,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Haichao,</font>

336
00:19:09,200 --> 00:19:09,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not Dahang!</font>

337
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:10,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, alright.</font>

338
00:19:11,030 --> 00:19:13,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's the technician Ms. Ahong
took over from the Lin family.</font>

339
00:19:13,200 --> 00:19:14,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't hurt him.</font>

340
00:19:15,070 --> 00:19:17,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guangzong, Guangzong!</font>

341
00:19:18,350 --> 00:19:20,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't let me see those
dead-fish eyes of yours again.</font>

342
00:19:20,510 --> 00:19:20,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guangzong.</font>

343
00:19:23,880 --> 00:19:25,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guangzong, Guangzong.</font>

344
00:19:46,640 --> 00:19:48,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this paper an exact match?</font>

345
00:19:48,200 --> 00:19:48,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

346
00:20:33,880 --> 00:20:35,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly the same, Guangzong.</font>

347
00:20:36,200 --> 00:20:36,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're rich!</font>

348
00:20:37,270 --> 00:20:38,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're rich, Guangzong!</font>

349
00:20:41,070 --> 00:20:42,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll report to Ms. Ahong right away.</font>

350
00:20:45,110 --> 00:20:45,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go ahead.</font>

351
00:20:46,070 --> 00:20:46,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You report it.</font>

352
00:20:51,790 --> 00:20:53,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Perfect!</font>

353
00:21:07,350 --> 00:21:07,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

354
00:21:08,590 --> 00:21:09,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it.</font>

355
00:21:10,030 --> 00:21:10,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good work, everyone.</font>

356
00:21:12,160 --> 00:21:12,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gotta go.</font>

357
00:21:23,240 --> 00:21:24,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now you dare to look at me.</font>

358
00:21:44,550 --> 00:21:45,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help me line up this shot.</font>

359
00:21:47,310 --> 00:21:48,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Ahong, I don't know how.</font>

360
00:21:49,070 --> 00:21:50,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to hit the ball into this hole.</font>

361
00:21:51,000 --> 00:21:51,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Set it up however you see fit.</font>

362
00:22:12,030 --> 00:22:12,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Try again.</font>

363
00:22:30,720 --> 00:22:32,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You did a good job.</font>

364
00:22:32,240 --> 00:22:33,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back when I was in a printing factory,</font>

365
00:22:34,510 --> 00:22:35,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if the angle of the large-format forms</font>

366
00:22:35,960 --> 00:22:37,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was even slightly off,</font>

367
00:22:37,110 --> 00:22:38,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I could spot it.</font>

368
00:22:38,510 --> 00:22:39,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've got a talent.</font>

369
00:22:40,310 --> 00:22:41,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You could really learn this.</font>

370
00:22:42,310 --> 00:22:44,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll have someone
send you a set of clubs someday.</font>

371
00:22:44,790 --> 00:22:45,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, Ms. Ahong.</font>

372
00:22:45,590 --> 00:22:46,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't learn it.</font>

373
00:22:46,920 --> 00:22:48,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I usually jump rope</font>

374
00:22:49,200 --> 00:22:50,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and play ping-pong.</font>

375
00:23:03,310 --> 00:23:04,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you find your wife?</font>

376
00:23:05,440 --> 00:23:06,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not yet.</font>

377
00:23:06,790 --> 00:23:08,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I heard from her old coworker</font>

378
00:23:08,790 --> 00:23:10,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that she went to Dongguan</font>

379
00:23:10,240 --> 00:23:11,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to work in garment making.</font>

380
00:23:12,960 --> 00:23:13,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come here.</font>

381
00:23:21,960 --> 00:23:22,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's in Hong Kong, China.</font>

382
00:23:25,640 --> 00:23:27,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">H-how do you know her whereabouts?</font>

383
00:23:27,510 --> 00:23:29,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is a copy of the entry-exit record.</font>

384
00:23:30,350 --> 00:23:31,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was hard to get.</font>

385
00:23:33,960 --> 00:23:35,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, yes, that's my wife for sure.</font>

386
00:23:36,160 --> 00:23:37,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">W-what is she doing in Hong Kong, China?</font>

387
00:23:39,350 --> 00:23:40,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could she go there?</font>

388
00:23:40,510 --> 00:23:41,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've already sent people
to look for her.</font>

389
00:23:42,240 --> 00:23:44,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They'll notify me when there's news.</font>

390
00:23:45,360 --> 00:23:47,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Missing Person: Jiang Xiaohong]</font>

391
00:23:47,000 --> 00:23:48,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, Ms. Ahong.</font>

392
00:23:48,400 --> 00:23:50,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This newspaper ad must be expensive.</font>

393
00:23:53,510 --> 00:23:54,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to go to Hong Kong, China.</font>

394
00:23:54,830 --> 00:23:55,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go find her.</font>

395
00:23:55,830 --> 00:23:56,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How will you go?</font>

396
00:23:57,270 --> 00:23:57,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

397
00:23:58,240 --> 00:23:59,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've never been there.</font>

398
00:23:59,830 --> 00:24:00,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know how...</font>

399
00:24:00,510 --> 00:24:02,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are only two ways
to Hong Kong, China now.</font>

400
00:24:03,240 --> 00:24:04,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By water or by land.</font>

401
00:24:05,350 --> 00:24:06,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whichever you choose,</font>

402
00:24:06,440 --> 00:24:07,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it takes time and money.</font>

403
00:24:09,030 --> 00:24:11,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You choose. I'll pay for it.</font>

404
00:24:12,110 --> 00:24:13,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no, Ms. Ahong.</font>

405
00:24:13,440 --> 00:24:14,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I-I didn't mean that.</font>

406
00:24:14,750 --> 00:24:16,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll figure it out myself.</font>

407
00:24:16,790 --> 00:24:18,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We barely know each other.</font>

408
00:24:18,680 --> 00:24:19,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've already helped me so much.</font>

409
00:24:19,830 --> 00:24:21,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know how to repay you.</font>

410
00:24:21,720 --> 00:24:22,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Saving you was fate.</font>

411
00:24:23,480 --> 00:24:24,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Helping you find your wife</font>

412
00:24:25,550 --> 00:24:27,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">completes this good karma.</font>

413
00:24:27,960 --> 00:24:29,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't need your repayment.</font>

414
00:24:29,550 --> 00:24:30,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, Ms. Ahong.</font>

415
00:24:30,830 --> 00:24:33,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Ahong, let me do something for you.</font>

416
00:24:38,550 --> 00:24:39,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your skills</font>

417
00:24:40,550 --> 00:24:42,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could really do me a small favor.</font>

418
00:26:01,200 --> 00:26:01,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep up.</font>

419
00:26:08,510 --> 00:26:10,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you guys usually take this road?</font>

420
00:26:11,030 --> 00:26:12,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll show you a shortcut.</font>

421
00:26:22,830 --> 00:26:23,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open the door.</font>

422
00:26:23,440 --> 00:26:24,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open the door.</font>

423
00:26:28,160 --> 00:26:28,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Liu.</font>

424
00:26:29,510 --> 00:26:30,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Liu.</font>

425
00:26:31,240 --> 00:26:32,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, Zhou.</font>

426
00:26:33,350 --> 00:26:34,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Zhou,</font>

427
00:26:34,200 --> 00:26:36,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the technical talent
Ms. Ahong introduced.</font>

428
00:26:36,790 --> 00:26:39,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Both young and strong.</font>

429
00:26:42,550 --> 00:26:43,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou Haiyang, right?</font>

430
00:26:44,400 --> 00:26:45,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

431
00:26:45,680 --> 00:26:47,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm the director
of Haichao Printing Factory,</font>

432
00:26:47,350 --> 00:26:48,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Liu Bingren.</font>

433
00:26:50,960 --> 00:26:51,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The road was rough, huh?</font>

434
00:26:52,590 --> 00:26:53,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not very.</font>

435
00:26:53,750 --> 00:26:55,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry for the trouble. It was necessary.</font>

436
00:26:55,720 --> 00:26:57,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A classified unit isn't easy to find.</font>

437
00:26:57,310 --> 00:26:58,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please understand.</font>

438
00:26:58,790 --> 00:27:00,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, let's get you a pass first.</font>

439
00:27:01,400 --> 00:27:01,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This way.</font>

440
00:27:02,830 --> 00:27:03,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a standard procedure.</font>

441
00:27:03,790 --> 00:27:05,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Make a pass for this man.</font>

442
00:27:05,790 --> 00:27:06,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

443
00:27:07,880 --> 00:27:08,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

444
00:27:24,550 --> 00:27:25,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Took the photo?</font>

445
00:27:25,680 --> 00:27:26,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

446
00:27:26,070 --> 00:27:26,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, get in the car.</font>

447
00:27:27,160 --> 00:27:28,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's still a bit of road ahead.</font>

448
00:27:28,270 --> 00:27:29,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We still need to ride?</font>

449
00:27:29,960 --> 00:27:30,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The factory area is huge.</font>

450
00:27:31,160 --> 00:27:32,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Gate One.</font>

451
00:27:32,440 --> 00:27:34,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gate Two is still some distance away.</font>

452
00:27:34,960 --> 00:27:36,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once you pass Gate Two,</font>

453
00:27:36,400 --> 00:27:37,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're truly inside the factory area.</font>

454
00:27:40,240 --> 00:27:42,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go. Quite a nice place.</font>

455
00:27:43,070 --> 00:27:45,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Chunjiang Tax Bureau]
Comrades, allow me to brief you.</font>

456
00:27:46,160 --> 00:27:49,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Jianye, the mastermind
behind the VAT invoice forgery,</font>

457
00:27:50,000 --> 00:27:52,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has already been prosecuted
by the procuratorate.</font>

458
00:27:53,000 --> 00:27:55,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The counterfeit production site
has been dismantled,</font>

459
00:27:56,030 --> 00:27:57,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and a large amount of counterfeit
equipment and raw materials</font>

460
00:27:58,350 --> 00:27:59,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">were seized.</font>

461
00:27:59,920 --> 00:28:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Although some suspects
are still at large,</font>

462
00:28:03,680 --> 00:28:06,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the police are already on their trail.</font>

463
00:28:07,160 --> 00:28:08,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You could say</font>

464
00:28:08,510 --> 00:28:11,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we've completed this phase of the task.</font>

465
00:28:11,830 --> 00:28:12,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A few days ago,</font>

466
00:28:12,920 --> 00:28:13,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I watched a movie,</font>

467
00:28:14,550 --> 00:28:15,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"007".</font>

468
00:28:16,000 --> 00:28:17,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think all you young people</font>

469
00:28:17,070 --> 00:28:17,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have probably seen it.</font>

470
00:28:18,750 --> 00:28:19,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you?</font>

471
00:28:19,640 --> 00:28:20,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have.</font>

472
00:28:20,200 --> 00:28:21,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As I was watching,</font>

473
00:28:23,880 --> 00:28:25,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I kept thinking about
our case-handling process.</font>

474
00:28:26,160 --> 00:28:27,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It really is very similar.</font>

475
00:28:28,960 --> 00:28:31,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Some comrades went in alone,</font>

476
00:28:31,720 --> 00:28:32,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">unarmed,</font>

477
00:28:32,830 --> 00:28:33,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">straight into the lion's den.</font>

478
00:28:34,030 --> 00:28:35,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They even got tortured.</font>

479
00:28:35,750 --> 00:28:36,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These are not tax officials.</font>

480
00:28:37,310 --> 00:28:38,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They are clearly secret agents.</font>

481
00:28:40,240 --> 00:28:41,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's praising you.</font>

482
00:28:41,830 --> 00:28:42,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you hear that?</font>

483
00:28:44,640 --> 00:28:46,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm saying all this to remind everyone</font>

484
00:28:47,920 --> 00:28:49,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that in future law enforcement,</font>

485
00:28:49,550 --> 00:28:52,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't always try to clash
head-on with the other side.</font>

486
00:28:53,270 --> 00:28:54,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need wisdom.</font>

487
00:28:54,590 --> 00:28:55,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need to protect yourselves.</font>

488
00:28:56,790 --> 00:28:57,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you hear that?</font>

489
00:28:58,000 --> 00:28:59,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nowadays, many lawbreakers</font>

490
00:28:59,880 --> 00:29:01,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">dare not provoke the police,</font>

491
00:29:01,350 --> 00:29:02,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so they bully us tax officials.</font>

492
00:29:03,240 --> 00:29:04,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just now,</font>

493
00:29:04,830 --> 00:29:06,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a veteran inspector
from Haidong District</font>

494
00:29:07,350 --> 00:29:09,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was pushed down the stairs
by lawbreakers.</font>

495
00:29:09,880 --> 00:29:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's still fighting for his life.</font>

496
00:29:11,680 --> 00:29:12,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We don't know if he'll make it.</font>

497
00:29:13,400 --> 00:29:14,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhang.</font>

498
00:29:15,160 --> 00:29:16,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Same as usual. After the meeting,</font>

499
00:29:17,200 --> 00:29:20,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">each department and section
will contribute voluntarily.</font>

500
00:29:20,440 --> 00:29:21,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">30 cents, 50 cents,</font>

501
00:29:21,510 --> 00:29:22,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">10, 20, 50, whatever you can afford,</font>

502
00:29:22,920 --> 00:29:24,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">depending on individual circumstances.</font>

503
00:29:24,960 --> 00:29:26,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Donate for the injured
and their families.</font>

504
00:29:27,920 --> 00:29:28,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Comrades,</font>

505
00:29:29,750 --> 00:29:31,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it is precisely because
the cost of crime is low</font>

506
00:29:32,160 --> 00:29:33,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that in the future,</font>

507
00:29:33,680 --> 00:29:35,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">VAT invoice crimes will only increase.</font>

508
00:29:38,550 --> 00:29:40,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Managing special VAT invoices well</font>

509
00:29:40,880 --> 00:29:42,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is no less important than
managing our currency well.</font>

510
00:29:43,200 --> 00:29:44,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our tax work</font>

511
00:29:44,880 --> 00:29:45,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is tied to building</font>

512
00:29:45,880 --> 00:29:48,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a fair, law-based market environment</font>

513
00:29:48,160 --> 00:29:49,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and even more to</font>

514
00:29:49,270 --> 00:29:50,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the development
and progress of the country.</font>

515
00:29:52,920 --> 00:29:53,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm counting on all of you.</font>

516
00:29:57,920 --> 00:29:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That much?</font>

517
00:29:58,920 --> 00:29:59,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Given how serious you are,</font>

518
00:29:59,830 --> 00:30:00,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've decided to help you out.</font>

519
00:30:09,440 --> 00:30:10,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

520
00:30:12,310 --> 00:30:13,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want to verify
the invoice info, right?</font>

521
00:30:13,920 --> 00:30:14,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just a moment.</font>

522
00:30:22,720 --> 00:30:24,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First copy, please read the number.</font>

523
00:30:25,200 --> 00:30:28,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">0776541.</font>

524
00:30:28,880 --> 00:30:30,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">0776541.</font>

525
00:30:31,640 --> 00:30:32,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, please hold on.</font>

526
00:30:33,270 --> 00:30:33,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yawen.</font>

527
00:30:34,480 --> 00:30:35,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait a moment.</font>

528
00:30:37,310 --> 00:30:38,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have him read it again.</font>

529
00:30:40,070 --> 00:30:41,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please read the invoice number again.</font>

530
00:30:42,790 --> 00:30:44,940
