707
00:39:11,030 --> 00:39:12,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He died back in 1990.</font>

708
00:39:12,400 --> 00:39:14,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nowadays, registering a company
under a dead person's name</font>

709
00:39:14,550 --> 00:39:16,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has become fairly common.</font>

710
00:39:17,280 --> 00:39:18,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's just insane.</font>

711
00:39:45,480 --> 00:39:47,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want embossed printing on this paper.</font>

712
00:39:48,800 --> 00:39:49,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you do it?</font>

713
00:39:50,670 --> 00:39:51,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The paper is too thin.</font>

714
00:39:51,920 --> 00:39:52,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The ink won't hold.</font>

715
00:39:56,280 --> 00:39:57,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you solve it?</font>

716
00:39:59,630 --> 00:40:00,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's hard to find classified units</font>

717
00:40:00,840 --> 00:40:02,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">like our factory.</font>

718
00:40:02,590 --> 00:40:04,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Half military, half civilian.</font>

719
00:40:04,320 --> 00:40:05,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We print things for the state,</font>

720
00:40:05,440 --> 00:40:06,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and things for private businesses too.</font>

721
00:40:06,710 --> 00:40:08,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But everything is confidential.
Understood?</font>

722
00:40:08,920 --> 00:40:09,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understood.</font>

723
00:40:09,760 --> 00:40:11,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The factory only
has internal phone lines.</font>

724
00:40:11,630 --> 00:40:13,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The only outside line is in my office.</font>

725
00:40:13,920 --> 00:40:16,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you need anything,
dial 0 at the duty room</font>

726
00:40:16,880 --> 00:40:18,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or come straight to my office.</font>

727
00:40:20,000 --> 00:40:21,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I call the shots here. Understood?</font>

728
00:40:21,800 --> 00:40:22,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understood.</font>

729
00:40:24,480 --> 00:40:25,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll take good care of you.</font>

730
00:41:03,590 --> 00:41:06,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't I tell you to show restraint?</font>

731
00:41:06,630 --> 00:41:07,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't I?</font>

732
00:41:08,280 --> 00:41:09,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Guangzong told you to beat him,</font>

733
00:41:09,920 --> 00:41:11,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so you just beat him to death?</font>

734
00:41:11,190 --> 00:41:14,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Run! Run!</font>

735
00:41:14,630 --> 00:41:16,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How do you explain this
to the higher-ups?</font>

736
00:41:17,550 --> 00:41:18,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How would I know?</font>

737
00:41:18,190 --> 00:41:19,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop right there! What are you doing?</font>

738
00:41:19,630 --> 00:41:20,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shut up!</font>

739
00:41:20,230 --> 00:41:21,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just beat him once.</font>

740
00:41:23,030 --> 00:41:24,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tired, huh? You want to use a car?</font>

741
00:41:25,320 --> 00:41:25,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll do it.</font>

742
00:41:27,110 --> 00:41:27,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get lost!</font>

743
00:41:42,400 --> 00:41:44,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take the body to
the south side of the island.</font>

744
00:41:44,590 --> 00:41:47,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Burn the clothes and ID,</font>

745
00:41:47,400 --> 00:41:48,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then dump him in the sea.</font>

746
00:41:50,070 --> 00:41:51,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Got it.
- Hurry up!</font>

747
00:43:31,150 --> 00:43:33,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Why do you need to hide♪</font>

748
00:43:33,270 --> 00:43:34,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪So♪</font>

749
00:43:35,240 --> 00:43:37,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Ordinary and simple♪</font>

750
00:43:38,270 --> 00:43:42,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I dare not look back on those days♪</font>

751
00:43:42,350 --> 00:43:45,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Clinging to broken wholeness♪</font>

752
00:43:45,970 --> 00:43:49,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The strength of worrying
about gain and loss♪</font>

753
00:43:49,040 --> 00:43:51,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Breaking means courage♪</font>

754
00:43:52,640 --> 00:43:56,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The ambitious young man♪</font>

755
00:43:56,650 --> 00:43:58,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Accompanied by loneliness♪</font>

756
00:43:59,550 --> 00:44:02,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Breaking through the tracks of time♪</font>

757
00:44:03,180 --> 00:44:06,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The remnants of dreams are uproaring♪</font>

758
00:44:07,080 --> 00:44:10,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At my lowest moments, I always look up♪</font>

759
00:44:10,980 --> 00:44:14,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more begging♪</font>

760
00:44:14,520 --> 00:44:20,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Wind is in my arms; the time is right♪</font>

761
00:44:21,330 --> 00:44:25,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Those years remain spotless
in my heart♪</font>

762
00:44:25,230 --> 00:44:27,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No one knows♪</font>

763
00:44:27,930 --> 00:44:31,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Set out♪</font>

764
00:44:31,110 --> 00:44:34,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Take off all the armor♪</font>

765
00:44:35,570 --> 00:44:37,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more regret♪</font>

766
00:44:37,460 --> 00:44:39,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more complaining♪</font>

767
00:44:39,310 --> 00:44:43,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more begging for mercy
in humiliation♪</font>

768
00:44:43,400 --> 00:44:49,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Wind is in my arms; the time is right♪</font>

769
00:44:49,900 --> 00:44:53,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Those years remain spotless
in my heart♪</font>

770
00:44:53,940 --> 00:44:56,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No one knows♪</font>

771
00:44:56,620 --> 00:44:59,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Set out♪</font>

772
00:44:59,780 --> 00:45:02,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Even if I fall again♪</font>

773
00:45:03,870 --> 00:45:05,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more regret♪</font>

774
00:45:05,630 --> 00:45:07,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more complaining♪</font>

775
00:45:07,440 --> 00:45:15,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more begging anyone for mercy♪</font>
